“Taking note of further statement on Oct blank by US rep reporting
                            that, in spite of these efforts, US Congress had concluded its blank
                            session before it cld address itself to repeal of Section 104;

“Recognizing that concessions granted by US Govt and guaranteed to all
                                CPs under the gen agmt have been
                            nullified within the meaning of Art XXIII of the gen agmt;
